      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra embarks on a journey out to a sea full of strange animals and familiar horrors. It's her way of escaping the puny world she once sunk down into.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
